licatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["7465002","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7465002,"initDialog":746500201,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[5042],"performCfg":"","priority":8,"questId":74650,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":746500201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5042,"speakerName":"Euphrasie","textMapHash":4143511058,"text":"All you need to do is find some time every week to read through the submissions to \"Tales of Humanity.\" Pick out a few commissions you'd like to handle, and come find me to collect your payment.","nextNodeIds":[746500202]},{"nodeId":746500202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5042,"speakerName":"Euphrasie","textMapHash":2695022866,"text":"Some commissions are so drop-dead simple you wouldn't believe it. But you shouldn't underestimate the value of your work.","nextNodeIds":[746500203]},{"nodeId":746500203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5042,"speakerName":"Euphrasie","textMapHash":112757474,"text":"For us, the problems in their submissions may appear to be easy and insignificant. But for the readers submitting their problems, they are like a splinter under their fingernails, impossible to remove or ignore.","nextNodeIds":[746500204]},{"nodeId":746500204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5042,"speakerName":"Euphrasie","textMapHash":1566830994,"text":"If we can help them extract these splinters, then in addition to the monetary rewards, you will also receive the respect and gratitude of the people, and your reputation among the citizenry will increase over time.","nextNodeIds":[746500205]},{"nodeId":746500205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5042,"speakerName":"Euphrasie","textMapHash":1635381146,"text":"When that happens, I will give you more complicated and important jobs, hehe.","nextNodeIds":[746500206]},{"nodeId":746500206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5042,"speakerName":"Euphrasie","textMapHash":1676691098,"text":"Help everyone to achieve happiness and be a lighthouse illuminating humanity, such is the calling of our paper. Such are the feelings and aspirations of every publisher.","nextNodeIds":[746500207]},{"nodeId":746500207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2524335098,"text":"No need for an interview?","nextNodeIds":[746500208]},{"nodeId":746500208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5042,"speakerName":"Euphrasie","textMapHash":3239006490,"text":"Interview? Your interview was complete before you even arrived.","nextNodeIds":[746500209]},{"nodeId":746500209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5042,"speakerName":"Euphrasie","textMapHash":3824651890,"text":"Don't be surprised. I have my ways. If I couldn't even manage that, how could I manage a newspaper?","nextNodeIds":[746500210]},{"nodeId":746500210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5042,"speakerName":"Euphrasie","textMapHash":2845813554,"text":"Alright, I've told you everything you need to know about this job. As for whether or not you want to take it, that's up to you now. Think it over.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7465002,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","